 typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_LOW_SorcerousSundries_DethroneScroll\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_LOW_SorcerousSundries_DethroneScroll\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">b2e1168a-021d-4a81-a041-6d2e1421a1fb</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b2e1168a-021d-4a81-a041-6d2e1421a1fb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b2e1168a-021d-4a81-a041-6d2e1421a1fb\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_LOW_DethroneScroll</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_LOW_DethroneScroll+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_LOW_DethroneScroll+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"> <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dethrone\" title=\"Dethrone\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Dethrone_Icon.webp/25px-Dethrone_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Dethrone_Icon.webp/38px-Dethrone_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Dethrone_Icon.webp/50px-Dethrone_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dethrone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Dethrone_Icon.webp/25px-Dethrone_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Dethrone_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dethrone\" title=\"Dethrone\">Dethrone</a>.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a bookshelf in the Karsus section of the <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Vault\" title=\"Sorcerous Vault\">Sorcerous Vault</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;319&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1000</span></li>\n<li>Obtained by reading <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Annals_of_Karsus\" title=\"The Annals of Karsus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Book_Special_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Book_Special_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Book_Special_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Book_Special_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Book_Special_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Book_Special_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Book_Special_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Book_Special_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Book_Special_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Annals_of_Karsus\" title=\"The Annals of Karsus\">The Annals of Karsus</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The Karsus section is unlocked by opening doors in this order: Silverhand, Abjuration, Silver. Pulling the lever at the end and returning to the beginning of the door puzzle lets the party enter the Karsus door.</li>\n<li>This scroll can be <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribed</a> into a <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizard's</a> spellbook, which allows <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dethrone\" title=\"Dethrone\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Dethrone_Icon.webp/20px-Dethrone_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Dethrone_Icon.webp/30px-Dethrone_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Dethrone_Icon.webp/40px-Dethrone_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dethrone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Dethrone_Icon.webp/20px-Dethrone_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Dethrone_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dethrone\" title=\"Dethrone\">Dethrone</a> to be cast using a <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 5 Spell Slot</a> once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">long rest</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195832\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.070 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.077 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2358/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36394/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9115/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1211502/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   63.504      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   63.504      1 -total\n 46.07%   29.257      8 Template:Icon_text\n 43.33%   27.519     27 Template:Trim\n 24.55%   15.591      3 Template:Uid\n 16.22%   10.302      3 Template:Template_style\n 12.21%    7.753      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n 11.22%    7.125      3 Template:Icon_link\n 10.34%    6.568      1 Template:Main_only\n  9.38%    5.954      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:14792-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195832 and revision id 379038. Rendering was trig